# ACC-WD-VET-01 · Polished Vetiver Cedar v1.0

A modern vetiver accord preserving natural vetiver complexity while polishing it with Vetival, cedar, Vertofix, mineral amber and citrus air.

**Category:** Woods  
**Recommended use:** 3–15% of perfume concentrate  
**Maturation:** 10–21 days  
**Monte Carlo pass:** 100.00%  
**Design score:** 100.00/100  
**Outcome:** `COMPUTATIONAL ACCORD DESIGN PASS`

